<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 10.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 10.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set the</p>
<p>following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev for</p>
<p>Saturday, May 10:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,499.40 (1,498.50)	CHF  1,044.30 (1,033.10)</p>
<p>    DEM    881.95 (877.83)	  GBP  2,429.80 (2,427.60)</p>
<p>    ATS    125.32 (124.31)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Friday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $26.85 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$22.27 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $49.12 million ($20.88 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
